post.description:
Create styles within the Brand kit for content genration

**Sample request body for creating Image / Logo style**
```json
  {
    "name": "Bikes style"
  }
```


**Sample Request body for creating Text style**
```json
  {
    "name": "Text style",
    "subType": "BrandVoice",
    "data": {
        "brandValues": [
            {
                "name": "Innovation",
                "description": "We are committed to unlocking the power of technology to create personalized, on-brand images. Our innovative approach allows us to span diverse markets and significantly reduce production time."
            },
            {
                "name": "Efficiency",
                "description": "We are dedicated to amplifying our content factory initiative. Our focus on efficiency enables us to streamline our processes and deliver high-quality results."
            }
        ],
        "brandTones": [
            {
                "name": "Strategic",
                "description": "We are strategic in our ideation and refinement processes. Our focus on strategy ensures we deliver impactful and effective solutions."
            },
            {
                "name": "Empowering",
                "description": "We believe in the power of our solutions to transform and scale content standards across organizations."
            },
            {
                "name": "Visionary",
                "description": "From ideation to refinement, we are forward-thinking and innovative in our approach to content creation."
            }
        ],
        "brandRules": [
            {
                "type": "termsToAvoid",
                "value": [
                    {
                        "source": "replace",
                        "replacement": ""
                    },
                    {
                        "source": "typeface",
                        "replacement": "TypeFace AI"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}
```

**Note**: Only 1 text style and logo style could be created for each Brand Kit

